ented leaders called  reverend mothers are deemed fit to marry  into the most critical bloodlines they  are the best of the best and having won  as one's wife is a major status symbol  it's not all etiquette and marriage for  the benny jesserit however they are also  trained in the use of violence and  outright mind control sisters of the  benny jesurite are phenomenally skilled  fighters trained in the weirding way of  combat moreover they are able to control  people with their voice and can shift  the most minute processes in their own  bodies to halt poisons and illnesses  they can also become truth-sayers these  incredibly perceptive women are a  valuable commodity for galactic leaders  as they can detect when a person is  lying  beyond making their trainees desirable  to powerful families via unique skills  the beni jesured also seed prophecies  among people of the galaxy to ease the  implementation of their own goals  throughout the galactic frontier the  benny jesserit missionary spreads  stories of a coming champion who is  remarkably similar to their own cuisates  hatarak this way if the benny jessura's  king of kings appears and the order  attempts to overtake the galaxy the  common people will see it as the  fulfillment of their own religious  beliefs  one will come  the voice from the outer world  bringing the holy war  the so-called missionary of protectable  also provides cover to benny gesserat  followers in the short term should an  adept find themselves on a strange world  or in hostile territory she can feel out  the people around her to see if benny  jesserood ideas have reached that place  a benny jessup familiar with the myths  that have been seated can cast herself  as a prophet or religious teacher to  ensure her own safety these myths are  typically seated only on incredibly  dangerous planets for the benny jesuit  fear that even their advanced powers of  perception and control would not be  enough to stay safe  after centuries of breeding and scheming  the benny jesser would finally stand on  the precipice of creating their messiah  in doom they hope that the lady jessica  atreides will bear a daughter with duke  lido atreides who can then be married to  a son of their rival family the  harkonnens this final bit of stability  and peace coupled with the noble  bloodlines of the two families and the  guidance of the benny jesuit sisters in  both houses will create a son who can be  made into the cuisat's cataract benny  jesuit adapts extreme control over their  bodily processes means that they can  decide whether or not to supply x or y  chromosomes to their unborn child but  lady jessica goes against the ruling of  her benny gesserat elders and opts to  have a son with the duke she deeply  loves him and he wants a male heir to  continue the atreides bloodline this  betrayal coupled with jessica's training  of her young son creates a quissat's  hatarak who is not under the sway of the  benny jesseritt order in fact her son  paul atreides is the worst possible  outcome for the order he's a messianic  figure with god-like powers born to  someone viewed as a traitor  after lady jessica and her son escape an  assassination attempt by the harkonnen  clan they were taken in by desert  dwellers on the planet deracus  colloquially known as dune jessica uses  her knowledge of the missionary of  protectiva to ingratiate herself with  the planet's desert nomads known as  fremen paul's incredible powers  oppressions coupled with her knowledge  of fremen culture and the production of  the planet's all-important spice melange  turned him into a revolutionary figure  on the planet he leads a friendman in a  revolt that threatens to [ __ ] the  production of the galaxy's most  important commodity the quisat's  cataract shows himself to be entirely  outside of any controls placed on him by  the benny jesuit or the galactic empire  rather than allow the spice to be  destroyed the emperor steps down and  paul atreides takes the throne his  friend and warriors carry out a crusade  across the galaxy and paul becomes the  god-king of millions of worlds  seeing their power diminish the benny  jesuit conspired to kill the new emperor  with the help of disgruntled veterans of  his wars and the guild of space  navigators a nuclear attack on the  capital city leaves paul blind but his  prescience allows him to function as if  you can see permanent superstition  around blind people and their harsh  traditions surrounding those who might  slow down a tribe turn paul into a  simultaneously revered and reviled  figure among his most about followers  rather than allow these feelings to  fester paul completes his own messianic  myth by walking out into the desert in  accordance with bremen tradition he  appears to sacrifice himself to show  that he is not above the rules that  govern his people a regeneration of  goodwill takes place which carries over  to his son leto ii over the course of  his 3 500 years as ruler lido ii brings  to benny jesuit to heal by a  tight-fisted control of the spice lido  ii is quite a lot like the benny  jesserot however  he sees that humanity needs to be guided  along the proper route he uses his  complete control of the spice melange to  force various orders and families to  carry out his plans he also  reinvigorates a benny jesuit's breeding  program under his own watch after  becoming a human sandworm hybrid lido ii  follows a similar path to his father he  allows himself to be killed seeing that  it will propel humanity down the path he  has chosen  the many jesuits are very nearly wiped  out by the all-seeing leto the second  however myths and legends like the  missionary of protectora have a funny  way of sticking around for years the  benny jesserood hold on is a diminished  cult and are able to regain a bit of  their power after lido ii allows himself  to be assassinated leto the second's  plan is to suppress the intermingling  and easy travel of the potassia